  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The death of Silva Nur Intania, a 17-year-old student at SMAN 7 in Malang, has triggered significant legal and social repercussions in Indonesia. Following the fatal bullying incident, the East Java Regional Police have detained four juvenile suspects, who are now held at a women's correctional facility. Authorities have confirmed that the assault involved elements of premeditation and are analyzing two new video recordings that may implicate further suspects. In addition to criminal proceedings, the East Java Education Office has officially expelled the four students involved, barring them from participating in school examinations. Tensions surrounding the case escalated on Saturday, November 28, 2026, leading to unrest at the residences of the suspects; police have since apprehended 38 people for their alleged roles in property damage and potential social media provocation.",
